Objective:-

The objective of Level 10 is to decode the password stored in data.txt.
The contents of the file are Base64 encoded.

Step 1 — Check the file
ls
You should see:
---bash
data.txt
Step 2 — View the encoded data
---bash
cat data.txt
Step 3 — Decode it
Use:
---bash
base64 -d data.txt
Explanation
cat data.txt – displays the contents of the file.
base64 – works with Base64 encoding/decoding.
-d – tells base64 to decode the input.
base64 -d data.txt – decodes the contents of data.txt.
